{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_160_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子、齊世子光，會吳於柤。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"會又會，外之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，甲午，遂滅傅陽。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"遂，直遂也。其曰遂何？不以中國從夷狄也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"三、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"會夷狄不致，惡事不致，此其致何也？存中國也。中國有善事，則並焉。無善事，則異之存之也。汲鄭，逃歸陳侯，柤之會，存中國也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"四、楚公子貞、鄭公孫輒帥師伐宋。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"五、晉師伐秦。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"六、秋，莒人伐我東鄙。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"七、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、齊世子光、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"八、冬，盜殺鄭公子斐、公子發、公孫輒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"稱盜以殺大夫，弗以上下道，惡上也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"九、戍鄭虎牢。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"其曰鄭虎牢，決鄭乎虎牢也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"十、楚公子貞帥師救鄭。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_160_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_160","textTraditional":"十一、公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}